    RefIds:
    - rid: 6806775745308524629
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor muttering to himself, hasn't noticed Renjiro yet
    - rid: 6806775745308524630
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor finally notices Renjiro; tired and apologetic tone
    - rid: 6806775745308524631
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro speaks in broken Spanish (foreigner conjugation)
    - rid: 6806775745308524632
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor explains the problem and contents; does NOT know
          where he lost it
    - rid: 6806775745308524638
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor reacts to seeing Renjiro again; anxious tone
    - rid: 6806775745308524639
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro reports progress in broken Spanish
    - rid: 6806775745308524640
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor urges him to hurry
    - rid: 6806775745308524641
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Mechanic reminder: both items, chests in sewers'
    - rid: 6806775745308524642
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: RENJIRO THINKING (internal monologue). Hint that something
          is still missing
    - rid: 6806775745308524643
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro leaves room for re-consulting without completing
    - rid: 6806775745308524644
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor light humor, caring tone
    - rid: 6806775745308524645
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Don Cucho muttering about his stall, hasn't noticed Renjiro
          yet
    - rid: 6806775745308524646
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro explains he brings the package
    - rid: 6806775745308524647
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Don Cucho recognizes the mailman and gets excited about the
          items
    - rid: 6806775745308524648
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "Lore: Aniki Magazine is an anime magazine from Valpara\xEDso;
          item was for his grandson"
    - rid: 6806775745308524649
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro reacts with mild recognition
    - rid: 6806775745308524650
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Don Cucho gives reward; generic (system handles actual reward)
    - rid: 6806775745308524651
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro modest, golden retriever tone
    - rid: 6806775745308524652
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Don Cucho closes with humor, sets up Completed conversation
    - rid: 6806775745308524653
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor muttering to himself before noticing Renjiro
    - rid: 6806775745308524654
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor notices Renjiro, eager to know how it went
    - rid: 6806775745308524655
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro confirms delivery in broken Spanish
    - rid: 6806775745308524656
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor relieved, grateful tone
    - rid: 6806775745308524657
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro modest, golden retriever tone
    - rid: 6806775745308524658
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor hints at future missions without committing
    - rid: 6806775745308524659
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor closes with humor, callback to Turn In
    - rid: 6806775745308524660
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'EXPIRED: Repartidor lamenting alone, does NOT address the
          player'
    - rid: 6806775745308524661
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'EXPIRED: Repartidor lamenting alone'
    - rid: 6806775745308524662
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'EXPIRED: Repartidor lamenting alone, resignation tone'
    - rid: 6806775745308524663
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'EXPIRED: Repartidor returns to his routine, does NOT address
          the player'
    - rid: 6806775745308524668
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: CHOICE OPTION A (ACCEPT) - Player selects to accept the quest.
          Branches to offeracceptconversation.
    - rid: 6806775745308524669
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: CHOICE OPTION B (REJECT) - Player selects to reject the quest.
          Branches to offerrejectconversation. Quest remains available if spoken
          to again.
    - rid: 6806775745308524670
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Entered from offerconversation_line5a (ACCEPT). Repartidor
          is surprised; he doesn't even know Renjiro's name
    - rid: 6806775745308524671
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'RENJIRO THINKING (internal monologue). Mechanic hint: chests/sewers/enemies'
    - rid: 6806775745308524672
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor gives delivery target instead of asking to return
          to him
    - rid: 6806775745308524673
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Renjiro confirms the delivery objective. Quest becomes ACTIVE
          at end of this line.
    - rid: 6806775745308524674
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Entered from offerconversation_line5b (REJECT). Repartidor
          takes it with resignation.
    - rid: 6806775745308524675
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Repartidor lamenting; quest remains available.
    - rid: 6806775745308524676
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Repartidor polite farewell. Quest remains AVAILABLE: next
          interaction restarts offerconversation from line1.'
